WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.391 --> 00:00:03.238
查看两条 Method 规则 / Review the two Method Rules

2
00:00:03.238 --> 00:00:06.042
查看 Guide POST queue / Inspect Guide POST queue

3
00:00:06.042 --> 00:00:08.886
查看 Guide PUT queue / Inspect Guide PUT queue

4
00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:11.737
返回 Capture / Return to Capture

5
00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:14.586
发送 POST-A，成为 Head / Send POST-A as the Head

6
00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:17.440
发送 POST-B，进入 Queued / Send POST-B into Queued

7
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.348
发送 PUT-A，HTTP 队列共三项 / Send PUT-A into the same HTTP queue

8
00:00:20.348 --> 00:00:23.490
选中 POST-A 队首 / Select the POST-A Head

9
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.340
为队首选择 Text / Choose Text for the Head draft

10
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.191
输入未提交草稿 / Enter an unsubmitted draft

11
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:32.196
切到 POST-B，只读 Queued / Inspect POST-B as read-only Queued

12
00:00:32.196 --> 00:00:35.093
切到 PUT-A，仍在等待 / Inspect PUT-A while it waits

13
00:00:35.093 --> 00:00:38.092
回到 Head，草稿保持 / Return to the Head with its draft intact

14
00:00:38.092 --> 00:00:41.096
展开批量操作菜单 / Open the batch actions menu

15
00:00:41.096 --> 00:00:44.248
Continue rule 仅放行 POST，PUT 保留 / Continue the POST Rule and leave PUT pending

16
00:00:44.248 --> 00:00:47.145
加入 PUT-B / Add PUT-B to the remaining queue

17
00:00:47.145 --> 00:00:50.096
展开 PUT 队列菜单 / Open the PUT queue menu

18
00:00:50.096 --> 00:00:53.103
Drop queue 丢弃剩余两项 / Drop both remaining HTTP items

19
00:00:53.103 --> 00:00:55.995
建立新 POST 队首 / Start a new POST Head

20
00:00:55.995 --> 00:00:58.897
把 PUT 加入同一 HTTP 队列 / Add PUT to the same HTTP queue

21
00:00:58.897 --> 00:01:01.807
选中新队首 / Select the new Head

22
00:01:01.807 --> 00:01:04.747
展开整个队列的菜单 / Open the whole-queue menu

23
00:01:04.747 --> 00:01:07.796
Continue queue 原样放行 POST 和 PUT / Continue both Methods without edits

24
00:01:07.796 --> 00:01:10.696
返回 Rules 清理 / Return to Rules for cleanup

25
00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:13.499
选中 POST 规则 / Select the POST Rule

26
00:01:13.499 --> 00:01:16.347
停用 POST 规则 / Disable the POST Rule

27
00:01:16.347 --> 00:01:19.195
选中 PUT 规则 / Select the PUT Rule

28
00:01:19.195 --> 00:01:22.045
停用 PUT 规则 / Disable the PUT Rule

29
00:01:22.045 --> 00:01:24.906
Apply 两条停用状态 / Apply both disabled Rules
